2025-11-01 02:57:55,208 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "

Gamora stepped between them, her voice tense.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,209 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "Both of you, stop.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,209 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax, DIALOGUE: "

Drax the Destroyer emerged from the shadows, his massive frame blocking what little light reached the canyon.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,210 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax, DIALOGUE: "I do not understand why we must sneak like cowards.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,210 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: We've got a walking tree who only says three words, a destroyer who wants to fight everything, a green assassin who's too serious, and a human who thinks he's the boss of me.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,211 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: "You know what?
2025-11-01 02:57:55,211 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax, DIALOGUE: I make no promises,
2025-11-01 02:57:55,211 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: s supposed to be the most dangerous woman in the galaxy, you
2025-11-01 02:57:55,212 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "

