2025-11-01 02:57:55,212 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "Don't get sentimental, Quill.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,212 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: Hey, I'm just saying—
2025-11-01 02:57:55,213 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: Rocket's voice crackled over their comms.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,213 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "I told you this would happen.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,213 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: "

