2025-11-01 02:57:55,216 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: Just focus on not getting us killed, Star-Lord.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,216 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax, DIALOGUE: But it worked great!"

