2025-11-01 02:57:55,217 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax, DIALOGUE: "Your weapons are useless against me!
2025-11-01 02:57:55,217 - INFO - SPEAKER: Drax the Destroyer, DIALOGUE: I am Drax the Destroyer!"


2025-11-01 02:57:55,217 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: The sudden silence was broken by Peter's voice.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,218 - INFO - SPEAKER: Peter, DIALOGUE: "Okay, that was actually pretty impressive.
2025-11-01 02:57:55,218 - INFO - SPEAKER: Gamora, DIALOGUE: "

